== alert rules: first alert in each trade (5823 trades; 14.6% base chance of a 5-day Supertrend exit, 22.0% base chance of a 6% drop in 10 sessions) ==
  VOLUME: distribution (3+ days) or a high-volume down day, with the close under the 10-day EMA zone
     fires in 49% of trades; after the alert: 6%+ drop within 10d 23.2% (train 19% (n 1494) / test 28% (n 1360)); Supertrend exit within 5d 35%; median days to the Supertrend exit 12; price at the eventual exit vs the alert close: avg 0.50%, lower in 69% of alerts
  STRUCTURE: close under the last swing low or the 5-day low
     fires in 90% of trades; after the alert: 6%+ drop within 10d 22.2% (train 20% (n 2915) / test 26% (n 2304)); Supertrend exit within 5d 29%; median days to the Supertrend exit 14; price at the eventual exit vs the alert close: avg 0.96%, lower in 68% of alerts
  GIVEBACK: gave back half the gain, or 3 ATR from the peak
     fires in 49% of trades; after the alert: 6%+ drop within 10d 23.1% (train 19% (n 1510) / test 28% (n 1340)); Supertrend exit within 5d 38%; median days to the Supertrend exit 11; price at the eventual exit vs the alert close: avg 0.91%, lower in 70% of alerts
  REVERSAL: bearish engulfing, shooting star or exhaustion candle after a run
     fires in 74% of trades; after the alert: 6%+ drop within 10d 21.6% (train 18% (n 2414) / test 26% (n 1897)); Supertrend exit within 5d 13%; median days to the Supertrend exit 23; price at the eventual exit vs the alert close: avg 1.07%, lower in 63% of alerts
  MOMENTUM: RSI under 50 and MACD histogram under 0 and -DI over +DI
     fires in 49% of trades; after the alert: 6%+ drop within 10d 21.8% (train 18% (n 1523) / test 27% (n 1332)); Supertrend exit within 5d 40%; median days to the Supertrend exit 9; price at the eventual exit vs the alert close: avg 0.64%, lower in 72% of alerts
  ANY TWO of: volume warning, structure break, giveback, reversal candle
     fires in 81% of trades; after the alert: 6%+ drop within 10d 22.9% (train 20% (n 2618) / test 27% (n 2099)); Supertrend exit within 5d 31%; median days to the Supertrend exit 13; price at the eventual exit vs the alert close: avg 0.82%, lower in 69% of alerts
